{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/key_features_6.png?t=1745064661\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Deckbuilding</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft &amp; Load your Backpack with Action-Items and Tarot Cards to create insane synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies can also have Tarot Cards and use Action-Items from their Backpacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/Sequence-01_9.gif?t=1745064661\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grid-based Tactics &amp; Telegraphed Attacks.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional Turn-based Tactics Movement/Prepare/Attack-system + additional use of your Backpack-Items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies Telegraphed Attacks preview their intended Actions and Attack-Order.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Crowd-Control effects such as Flip, Pin, Push, Pull, Provoke &amp; Mindcontrol or Place/Manipulate surrounding Objects/Terrain/Traps to dominate the Battle-Grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a party of multiple units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a mistake? Rewind your Turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Fast-paced Turn Handling and QoL Features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/desert_loot2.gif?t=1745064661\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Replayability &amp; Difficulty</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Crawling, Push-Your-Luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proc-gen + Handcrafted Quest/Level-design 